    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** As per instructions of the Executor **\r\n**PROBATE HAS NOW BEEN GRANTED**\r\n\r\nTucked away in this sleepy cul-de-sac is where you find this delightful, 3 bedroom end of terrace home for sale. No.26 is presented in good decorative order throughout and extends to c.77.5 metres sq. The windows are double glazed and the gas boiler has been upgraded.\r\n\r\nA real highlight is the large garage space to the side which would be ideal for a number of uses eg., erection of a garage/workshop, specialist vehicle parking or an extension to the existing home, all subject to P.P. There is also a separate rear garden which enjoys a sunny aspect and comes with a modern steel shed.\r\n\r\nThe location is simply 1st class with Bayside Dart station just a c.10 minute walk away, along with both primary and secondary schools close by. Seagrange park is just 100 metres from your front door providing for a host of leisure activities. With its unbeatable location and fantastic space to the side, we must now advise on early viewings to avoid disappointment. A little gem!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation consists of entrance hallway, sitting room and kitchen/breakfast-room. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are located on your doorstep including Bayside dart station which is just a c.5 minute walk away with a selection of both primary and secondary schools, childcare, shopping in the Racecourse Shopping Centre with Lidl, pharmacy and coffee/restaurant shop, etc. Baldoyle also boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School. There is a vast array of leisure activities and all just a short distance to the seafront."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 3.63m x 1.24m \r\nA welcoming hallway with storm porch. Understairs storage.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.33m x 3.03m \r\nA warm and comfortable sitting room with a front aspect, wooden floor and TV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 4.13m x 4.31m \r\nThe heartbeat of this fine home is this dual aspect kitchen enjoying a sunny south facing aspect. Fully fitted kitchen with cooker, part tiled walls and door to outside.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing Area - 1.85m x 4.03m \r\nHotpress.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - Front - 4.35m x 2.6m \r\nA generous sized master bedroom which benefits from a dual aspect. Built in wardrobes and wooden floors.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Side) - 2.43m x 2.4m \r\nSingle bedroom with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Rear) - 2.92m x 2.38m \r\nDouble bedroom with wooden floor.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 1.84m x 1.92m \r\nBath, W.C., W.H.B. Tiled walls and rain shower.\n\r\n\r\nOutside Front/Side - 14.0m x 8.45m \r\nA real highlight of this fine home is the large space to side which would be ideal for further development, garage space or extra parking ( all subject to planning permission ). Tarmac drive, fully walled. Gated side entrance.\n\r\n\r\nRear - 10.0m x 5.48m \r\nA separate rear garden with its mature, fully walled and tarmac. Steel shed and outside tap. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Corner House.\r\nChain Free Sale.\r\nGas Heating.\r\nTremendous Off-St-Parking Area.\r\nIdeal For Further Development. ( S.T.P.P.)\r\nWalking Distance To Dart station.\r\nDouble Glazed Windows.\r\nBER C\r\nAccommodation Extends To c.75 sq.mt.\r\nAll Amenities On Your Doorstep.\r\nGarage Space To Side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
